{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/d2a211d87357be48253a7432b304f9e0.webp?t=1757504102\" width=250 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay similar to Only Up.\u00a0</strong>Super Chili Man is a third-person platformer where players control a flexible and resilient magical chili pepper. leaping upward through a giant pot constructed from vegetables, fruits, and all kinds of food. Navigate by deftly avoiding or utilizing obstacles like swinging hammers, bounce pads, bombs, and cannons. Be warned\u2014one wrong move might send you plunging to the bottom of the pot, but every mistake also grants valuable experience for your next climb!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/cedc7a4757a8eab3e4c9194f85c48e9c.poster.avif?t=1757504102\" width=640 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/cedc7a4757a8eab3e4c9194f85c48e9c.webm?t=1757504102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/cedc7a4757a8eab3e4c9194f85c48e9c.mp4?t=1757504102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/6161fc16c3d384fde1cf94eb38dcee6d.webp?t=1757504102\" width=250 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic obstacles and new mechanics! Including shifting level structures as the soup water level changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/0123188f79f0a696512a028dce07d35e.poster.avif?t=1757504102\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/0123188f79f0a696512a028dce07d35e.webm?t=1757504102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/0123188f79f0a696512a028dce07d35e.mp4?t=1757504102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/22a9c5950ec45ebde60c55e6f320fe88.webp?t=1757504102\" width=250 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based explosives, cannons, and bounce pads. Carefully control your chili\u2014or get blasted away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/1db0383fe5b468ccc58718e03aab2fe3.poster.avif?t=1757504102\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/1db0383fe5b468ccc58718e03aab2fe3.webm?t=1757504102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/1db0383fe5b468ccc58718e03aab2fe3.mp4?t=1757504102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X\uff1aChillX (@xu4086015626872) / X</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846870?t=1757504102","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846870?t=1757504102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/8bdbda3472533bc5908297e5c75cb7486ac55c46/capsule_